  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 19 November 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nOffered to the market for the first time, this immaculate standalone brick-and-tile home occupies a flat, sunny, low-maintenance freehold site.\r\n\r\nFeaturing three generous bedrooms, open-plan living flowing outdoors, a family bathroom, separate second toilet and internal-access garaging. A tidy garden and practical storage and workshop sheds complete the picture.\r\n\r\nSet in a quiet cul-de-sac with direct walkway access into town, you’re an easy stroll from the beach, cafés, shops and everyday amenities.\r\n\r\nContact us for a private viewing or join us at our next open home.",
